  "description": "Redevelopment and reconfiguration of the existing mixed-use building at 384 High Road, Leyton, comprising retention of Class E commercial accommodation at lower ground floor level and upper ground floor level; provision of 4 self-contained residential units above, comprising 1 x 1-bedroom flat at upper ground floor level, 1 x 2-bedroom flat at first floor level, 1 x 3-bedroom flat at second floor level and 1 x 1-bedroom one-person flat at third floor / roof level; basement / lower ground floor enlargement and reconfiguration; rear extensions and rear elevation refinement; roof enlargement with rear dormer; secure enclosed cycle storage for 8 bicycles at lower ground floor level; private rear terraces and balconies with chamfered decorative privacy screens at approximately 1.7m height; planted roof terrace garden; and associated internal reconfiguration, external alterations, drainage, cycle storage, refuse, landscaping and ancillary works.",
